                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [total gmv all over platform].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● daily V/O FD orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [# Vendor/Own funded deal orders defined by deal type]</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'> divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [days].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● daily deal orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [# deal orders defined by deal type]</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'> divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [days].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● % V/O FD utilization over deal orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [daily Vendor/Own funded deal orders]</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'> divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [daily deal orders].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● % V/O FD utilization over deal Vx all orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [daily Vendor/Own funded deal orders]</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'> divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [all orders of vendors who joined the deal event].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● daily V/O FD value</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [Vendor/Own funded deal value defined by deal type]</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'> divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [days].</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='89600' id='5' type-v2='text' w='49429' x='50000' y='9600'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● % V/O FD value over gfv</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [daily Vendor/Own funded deal value] </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'>divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [daily gfv].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● V/O FD Vx</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [count number of the unique vendor who sold Vendor/Own funded deal orders].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● deal Vx</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [count number of the unique vendor who sold deal orders].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● % V/O FD Vx over deal Vx</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [Vendor/Own funded deal Vx] </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'>divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [deal Vx].</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>● % V/O FD Vx over outlet</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>    [Vendor/Own funded deal Vx] </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Tableau Light'>divided by</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> [# outlets].</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
